License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

SPDX identifier: Apache-2.0.

## No legal advice

Jurisdictional regulatory records in `rules/` are decision-support data, not legal advice. Any rule marked `DRAFT — requires legal/regulatory review` is non-operative and must not be used as autonomous authority for external notification, quarantine, movement restriction, or other regulatory action.
